    "created_at": "2018-07-05T08:09:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-07-05T08:09:30Z",
    "body": "Related: when `.sheet` property for both `<style>` and `<link rel=stylesheet>` becomes available is unclear.\r\n\r\nAccording to https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2997#issuecomment-326838981 CSS parsing should be observed _atomic_, so things will happen in this order\r\n1. loading completes\r\n2. stylesheet is parsed\r\n3. `CSSStyleSheet` object is ready (including cssRules being populated)\r\n4. `.sheet` is associated with the object\r\n5. `document.styleSheets` reflects the object\r\n6. `load` or `error` event is fired against its owner node",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
