    "updated_at": "2022-11-26T22:32:24Z",
    "body": "As per https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/4031 (specifically https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/4031#issuecomment-441423108) I think this issue can be closed. Everything in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/696#issuecomment-402640713 seems to be properly specified in the way that the comment outlines, with the exception of the CSS parsing particulars, which is tracked by https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2997 specifically. But the order of all the other steps, including their relation to the hand-wavy CSS rule parsing, looks right to me.\r\n\r\nI'll close this now, but please re-open if you think I am mistaken.",
